      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "An entry is committed once the leader has replicated it on a majority of servers."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "0123456789abcdef:2:5-log-replication/5-2-committing-entries:2#b1",
      "kind": "code",
      "text": "func (l *Log) advanceCommit(matchIndex []int) {\n\tsort.Ints(matchIndex)\n\tmajority := matchIndex[len(matchIndex)/2]\n\tif majority > l.commitIndex {\n\t\tl.commitIndex = majority\n\t}\n}"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "0123456789abcdef:2:5-log-replication/5-2-committing-entries:2#b2",
      "kind": "math",
      "text": "majority = floor(n / 2) + 1"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "0123456789abcdef:2:5-log-replication/5-2-committing-entries:2#b3",
      "kind": "figure",
      "text": "Figure 5.2 The commit index advances when a majority has the entry."
    }
